// One tone per resource, drawn from the library's own accent set (the same
// emerald / amber / rose / slate the Badge and Avatar components use). An
// event's colour is its resource's colour, so a cross-column drag recolours
// it and there is no separate palette to keep inside the two-accent rule.
type Tone = "emerald" | "amber" | "rose" | "slate";
type ViewMode = "today" | "day" | "week" | "month";

